==Battleground==
*1 [[Doge]] spawns.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6~10 seconds<sup>180f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
Spam [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cats]]. You really don't have a choice anyway...

==='''Chapters 2 & 3'''===
Spam [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cats]].

==Tutorial==
A brief tutorial guides the player through the basics of [[Battle|battle]] when attacking Korea for the first time. If the player loses the fight, they will be returned to the [[Main Menu]] screen.
*''Attack the enemy base!''
*''About Cats: Tap this icon to produce a Cat!''
*''About Cats: You need money (not real, duh) to produce cats! Wait until enough is saved up!''
*''Produce cats: Now let's sortie some Cats! Tap the icon below!''
*''Produce cats: Cats attack the enemy base automatically Save money first, and keep producing Cats!''
*''Get more money: Tap the [[Worker Cat|icon]] indicated by the arrow to increase money production speed!''
*''Fire the [[Cat Cannon]]! An icon appears when the Cat Cannon is ready to fire. Lure the enemies into firing range, and then FIRE!''

